<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#06996b">
    <title>EduTrack Guardian App</title>
    <link rel="manifest" href="/parent-manifest.webmanifest">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ink: #10231c;
            --muted: #d9fff0;
            --green: #06996b;
            --green-deep: #037252;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --line: #d7e6df;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: #fff;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 88% 8%, rgba(255,255,255,0.18) 0 126px, transparent 128px),
                radial-gradient(circle at 24% 42%, rgba(77,255,186,.16), transparent 310px),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #08ad78 0%, #078a62 52%, #045c42 100%);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        body::after {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            left: -12vw;
            right: -12vw;
            bottom: -190px;
            height: 330px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
            transform: rotate(3deg);
            z-index: -1;
        }
        .wrap { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; }
        .brand-bar { height: 92px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; }
        .brand img { width: 46px; height: 46px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; padding: 3px; }
        .brand strong { display: block; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.1; }
        .brand span { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.84); font-size: 12px; }
        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: .9fr 1fr;
            gap: clamp(44px, 6vw, 92px);
            align-items: center;
            padding: 16px 0 140px;
        }
        .phone-shell {
            width: min(318px, 92vw);
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 39px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ff9d1f 0%, #f47b12 42%, #7a2100 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 38px 96px rgba(4,55,42,.28), inset 0 0 0 5px rgba(29,15,8,.88);
            position: relative;
        }
        .phone-shell::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 14px;
            left: 50%;
            width: 86px;
            height: 22px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #0c1512;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            z-index: 4;
        }
        .phone-screen {
            height: 586px;
            border: 2px solid #17110c;
            border-radius: 31px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #f4faf7;
            color: var(--ink);
        }
        .phone-header {
            padding: 39px 12px 11px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.96);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2ece7;
        }
        .phone-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
        .phone-brand img { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; padding: 2px; }
        .phone-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; }
        .phone-subtitle { font-size: 9px; color: #62756d; }
        .phone-body { padding: 12px; }
        .greeting-card {
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #dbe8e2;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(16,35,28,.12);
            padding: 15px;
        }
        .greeting-card small { color: #62756d; font-weight: 800; }
        .greeting-card h3 { margin: 4px 0 7px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; }
        .student-mini { display: grid; gap: 9px; margin-top: 14px; }
        .student-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr auto;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 9px;
            border: 1px solid #dcebe4;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 9px;
            background: #f8fcfa;
        }
        .avatar { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #dcfce7; color: #047857; font-weight: 900; }
        .student-row strong { display: block; font-size: 12px; }
        .student-row span { display: block; font-size: 9px; color: #62756d; margin-top: 2px; }
        .pill { border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 8px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900; background: #dcfce7; color: #047857; }
        .phone-nav { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5,1fr); gap: 4px; padding: 9px 11px; background: #fff; border-top: 1px solid #e2ece7; margin-top: 12px; }
        .phone-nav div { text-align: center; font-size: 8px; color: #62756d; font-weight: 800; }
        .phone-nav i { display: block; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 3px; color: #06996b; }
        .hero-copy .live-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 8px 13px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 26px;
        }
        .live-dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff4d4d; box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(255,77,77,.12); }
        h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 70px); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin: 0 0 22px; }
        .hero-copy p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); max-width: 640px; }
        .actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 28px; }
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            min-height: 56px;
            padding: 0 28px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .btn.primary { background: #0c1512; color: #fff; }
        .btn.secondary { background: #fff; color: #047857; }
        .notice { margin-top: 18px; color: #fef3c7; font-weight: 800; max-width: 560px; }
        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-bottom: 110px; }
            .hero-copy { text-align: center; }
            .hero-copy p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
            .actions { justify-content: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrap">
        <header class="brand-bar">
            <a class="brand" href="/Download-app">
                <img src="<%= branding.system_logo || '/uploads/logos/system-logo.png' %>" alt="EduTrack logo">
                <span><strong><%= branding.system_name || 'EduTrack' %></strong><span><%= branding.division_name || 'Schools Division of Sipalay City' %></span></span>
            </a>
        </header>

        <section class="hero-grid">
            <div class="phone-shell" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="phone-screen">
                    <div class="phone-header">
                        <div class="phone-brand">
                            <img src="<%= branding.system_logo || '/uploads/logos/system-logo.png' %>" alt="">
                            <div>
                                <div class="phone-title">EduTrack Guardian</div>
                                <div class="phone-subtitle">Child attendance monitor</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="phone-body">
                        <div class="greeting-card">
                            <small>Good afternoon</small>
                            <h3>Guardian</h3>
                            <small>Monitor your children live</small>
                            <div class="student-mini">
                                <div class="student-row">
                                    <div class="avatar">JD</div>
                                    <div><strong>Juan Dela Cruz</strong><span>Grade 3 - Apple</span></div>
                                    <div class="pill">Inside</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="student-row">
                                    <div class="avatar">AB</div>
                                    <div><strong>Ana Buenaventura</strong><span>Grade 6 - Sampaguita</span></div>
                                    <div class="pill">Time In</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="phone-nav">
                            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i>Home</div>
                            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check"></i>Attendance</div>
                            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-bell"></i>Alerts</div>
                            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>Adviser</div>
                            <div><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i>Profile</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-copy">
                <div class="live-pill"><span class="live-dot"></span> EduTrack Guardian App</div>
                <h1>Monitor Your Child&apos;s Attendance in Real Time</h1>
                <p>See time in, late arrivals, lunch out, PM time in, early out, completed attendance, absences, and school announcements from the same secure EduTrack platform.</p>
                <p>Guardians can only view children linked to their registered guardian contact number.</p>
                <% if (missing) { %>
                    <div class="notice">The guardian APK has not been uploaded yet. You can open the Guardian Portal now and install it as a web app from your mobile browser.</div>
                <% } %>
                <div class="actions">
                    <a class="btn primary" href="/download/parent-app"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Download Guardian App</a>
                    <a class="btn secondary" href="/parent/app"><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen"></i> Open Guardian Portal</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
